## Targets (KPIs the dashboard evaluates against)

| Metric | Target | Acceptable | Kill threshold |
|---|---|---|---|
| CPR (cost per registration / lead) | ${CPR_TARGET} | ${CPR_ACCEPTABLE} | > ${CPR_KILL} |
| CPM | < ${CPM_TARGET} | < ${CPM_ACCEPTABLE} | > ${CPM_KILL} |
| CTR (link) | > {CTR_TARGET}% | > {CTR_ACCEPTABLE}% | < {CTR_KILL}% |
| Frequency | < 1.5 | < 2.0 | > 2.5 |
| Events/wk (learning phase) | > 50 | > 30 | < 20 |

---

## Decision gates (cumulative spend triggers)

- **Day 3** (~${SPEND_DAY3} spent) — first read CPM/CTR. Spot creative bombs early.
- **Day 7** (~${SPEND_DAY7} spent) — first CPR ballpark. Kill creatives clearly above ceiling.
- **Day 14** (~${SPEND_DAY14} spent) — unlock decision. If CPR on target + CAC trending well, unlock budget.
- **Day 21** (~${SPEND_DAY21} spent) — LAL trigger. Build 1% lookalike if registrant audience > 50 seed.
- **Day 28** (~${SPEND_DAY28} spent) — month 2 decision. Scale, pivot, or kill.

