## Exit criteria

The campaign ends (decision time) when ANY of:
- [ ] 50 conversion events accumulated in 7 days (learning phase exit)
- [ ] ${BUDGET_MONTHLY} spent (monthly cap)
- [ ] 28 days elapsed
- [ ] CPR below ${CPR_TARGET} sustained for 5 days (win — scale)
- [ ] CPR above ${CPR_KILL} sustained for 5 days (kill — iterate)
